<tool id="eionet_data_extraction" name="EIONET Species Data - Article 12 &amp; 17" version="1.0.0" profile="21.05">

    <description>Extract EIONET Art. 12 and Art. 17 species status and population data</description>

    <requirements>
        <requirement type="package" version="4.5.3">r-base</requirement>
        <requirement type="package" version="1.4.8">r-httr</requirement>
        <requirement type="package" version="1.0.5">r-rvest</requirement>
        <requirement type="package" version="1.5.2">r-xml2</requirement>
        <requirement type="package" version="1.8.2">r-optparse</requirement>
        <requirement type="package" version="1.2.1">r-dplyr</requirement>
    </requirements>

    <command detect_errors="exit_code"><![CDATA[
        mkdir -p output_files &&

        #if str($directive.choice) == "art12"
            Rscript '$__tool_directory__/eionet_fetch.R'
                --source 'art12'
                --subject '$directive.subject'
                --period '$directive.period'
                #if str($directive.country) != ''
                    --country '$directive.country'
                #end if
        #else
            Rscript '$__tool_directory__/eionet_fetch.R'
                --source 'art17'
                --subject '$directive.subject'
                --group '$directive.group'
                --period '$directive.period'
                #if str($directive.region) != ''
                    --region '$directive.region'
                #end if
                #if str($directive.country) != ''
                    --country '$directive.country'
                #end if
        #end if
    ]]></command>

    <inputs>

        <conditional name="directive">
            <param name="choice"
                   type="select"
                   label="Directive / taxonomic group"
                   help="Birds are reported under Article 12 of the Birds Directive; every other species group (mammals, reptiles, plants, etc.) is reported under Article 17 of the Habitats Directive.">
                <option value="art12" selected="true">Birds (Article 12 - Birds Directive)</option>
                <option value="art17">Other species group (Article 17 - Habitats Directive)</option>
            </param>

            <when value="art12">
                <param name="subject"
                       type="text"
                       label="Species latin name"
                       help="Latin (scientific) name of the bird species. Example: Ciconia ciconia, Corvus corax, Branta bernicla.
                             The name must match exactly the species list on the EIONET Article 12 portal."
                       optional="false">
                    <validator type="empty_field" message="Please provide a species latin name."/>
                </param>

                <param name="period"
                       type="select"
                       label="Reporting period"
                       help="Select the Article 12 reporting period.">
                    <option value="2019-2024" selected="true">2019-2024</option>
                    <option value="2013-2018">2013-2018</option>
                    <option value="2008-2012">2008-2012</option>
                    <option value="2008-2012bis">2008-2012bis</option>
                </param>

                <param name="country" multiple="true"
                       type="select"
                       label="Country (optional)"
                       help="Filter results for a specific EU Member State. Leave as 'All countries' to retrieve data for all Member States."
                       optional="true">
                    <option value="all_countries" selected="true">-- All countries --</option>
                    <option value="EU">EU population status (EU28)</option>
                    <option value="AT">Austria (AT)</option>
                    <option value="BE">Belgium (BE)</option>
                    <option value="BG">Bulgaria (BG)</option>
                    <option value="CY">Cyprus (CY)</option>
                    <option value="CZ">Czech Republic (CZ)</option>
                    <option value="DE">Germany (DE)</option>
                    <option value="DK">Denmark (DK)</option>
                    <option value="EE">Estonia (EE)</option>
                    <option value="ES">Spain - mainland (ES)</option>
                    <option value="ESIC">Spain - Canary Islands (ESIC)</option>
                    <option value="FI">Finland (FI)</option>
                    <option value="FR">France (FR)</option>
                    <option value="GIB">Gibraltar (GIB)</option>
                    <option value="GR">Greece (GR)</option>
                    <option value="HR">Croatia (HR)</option>
                    <option value="HU">Hungary (HU)</option>
                    <option value="IE">Ireland (IE)</option>
                    <option value="IT">Italy (IT)</option>
                    <option value="LT">Lithuania (LT)</option>
                    <option value="LU">Luxembourg (LU)</option>
                    <option value="LV">Latvia (LV)</option>
                    <option value="MT">Malta (MT)</option>
                    <option value="NL">Netherlands (NL)</option>
                    <option value="PL">Poland (PL)</option>
                    <option value="PT">Portugal - mainland (PT)</option>
                    <option value="PTAC">Portugal - Azores (PTAC)</option>
                    <option value="PTMA">Portugal - Madeira (PTMA)</option>
                    <option value="RO">Romania (RO)</option>
                    <option value="SE">Sweden (SE)</option>
                    <option value="SI">Slovenia (SI)</option>
                    <option value="SK">Slovakia (SK)</option>
                    <option value="UK">United Kingdom (UK)</option>
                </param>
            </when>

            <when value="art17">
                <param name="group"
                       type="select"
                       label="Taxonomic group"
                       help="Select the species group as listed on the EIONET Article 17 portal.">
                    <option value="Amphibians">Amphibians</option>
                    <option value="Arthropods">Arthropods</option>
                    <option value="Fish">Fish</option>
                    <option value="Mammals" selected="true">Mammals</option>
                    <option value="Molluscs">Molluscs</option>
                    <option value="Non-vascular plants">Non-vascular plants</option>
                    <option value="Other invertebrates">Other invertebrates</option>
                    <option value="Reptiles">Reptiles</option>
                    <option value="Vascular plants">Vascular plants</option>
                </param>

                <param name="subject"
                       type="text"
                       label="Species latin name"
                       help="Latin (scientific) name of the species, exactly as listed on the EIONET Article 17 portal for the chosen group. Example: Canis lupus, Lynx lynx, Rosalia alpina."
                       optional="false">
                    <validator type="empty_field" message="Please provide a species latin name."/>
                </param>

                <param name="period"
                       type="select"
                       label="Reporting period"
                       help="Select the Article 17 reporting period.">
                    <option value="2019-2024" selected="true">2019-2024</option>
                    <option value="2013-2018">2013-2018</option>
                    <option value="2007-2012bis">2007-2012bis</option>
                    <option value="2007-2012">2007-2012</option>
                    <option value="2001-2006">2001-2006</option>
                </param>

                <param name="region"
                       type="select"
                       label="Bio-geographical region (optional)"
                       help="Restrict results to a single bio-geographical region. Leave as 'All bioregions' to retrieve data for every region the species is reported in."
                       optional="true">
                    <option value="" selected="true">-- All bioregions --</option>
                    <option value="ALP">Alpine</option>
                    <option value="ATL">Atlantic</option>
                    <option value="BLS">Black Sea</option>
                    <option value="BOR">Boreal</option>
                    <option value="CON">Continental</option>
                    <option value="MED">Mediterranean</option>
                    <option value="PAN">Pannonian</option>
                </param>

                <param name="country" multiple="true"
                       type="select"
                       label="Country (optional)"
                       help="Filter results for a specific EU Member State. Leave as 'All countries' to retrieve data for all Member States."
                       optional="true">
                    <option value="all_countries" selected="true">-- All countries --</option>
                    <option value="EU">EU biogeographical assessment (not available for 2019-2024)</option>
                    <option value="AT">Austria (AT)</option>
                    <option value="BE">Belgium (BE)</option>
                    <option value="BG">Bulgaria (BG)</option>
                    <option value="CY">Cyprus (CY)</option>
                    <option value="CZ">Czech Republic (CZ)</option>
                    <option value="DE">Germany (DE)</option>
                    <option value="DK">Denmark (DK)</option>
                    <option value="EE">Estonia (EE)</option>
                    <option value="ES">Spain - mainland (ES)</option>
                    <option value="ESIC">Spain - Canary Islands (ESIC)</option>
                    <option value="FI">Finland (FI)</option>
                    <option value="FR">France (FR)</option>
                    <option value="GIB">Gibraltar (GIB)</option>
                    <option value="GR">Greece (GR)</option>
                    <option value="HR">Croatia (HR)</option>
                    <option value="HU">Hungary (HU)</option>
                    <option value="IE">Ireland (IE)</option>
                    <option value="IT">Italy (IT)</option>
                    <option value="LT">Lithuania (LT)</option>
                    <option value="LU">Luxembourg (LU)</option>
                    <option value="LV">Latvia (LV)</option>
                    <option value="MT">Malta (MT)</option>
                    <option value="NL">Netherlands (NL)</option>
                    <option value="PL">Poland (PL)</option>
                    <option value="PT">Portugal - mainland (PT)</option>
                    <option value="PTAC">Portugal - Azores (PTAC)</option>
                    <option value="PTMA">Portugal - Madeira (PTMA)</option>
                    <option value="RO">Romania (RO)</option>
                    <option value="SE">Sweden (SE)</option>
                    <option value="SI">Slovenia (SI)</option>
                    <option value="SK">Slovakia (SK)</option>
                    <option value="UK">United Kingdom (UK)</option>
                </param>
            </when>
        </conditional>

    </inputs>

    <outputs>
        <data name="output_ms" from_work_dir="output_files/MS_data.txt"
              format="tabular"
              label="EIONET Art12 - ${directive.subject} (${directive.period})">
            <filter>directive['choice'] == 'art12' and (not directive['country'] or directive['country'] not in (['EU'], 'EU'))</filter>
        </data>
        <data name="output_eu" from_work_dir="output_files/EU_data.txt"
              format="tabular"
              label="EIONET Art12 EU - ${directive.subject} (${directive.period})">
            <filter>directive['choice'] == 'art12' and (not directive['country'] or 'EU' in directive['country'])</filter>
        </data>
        <data name="output_art17" from_work_dir="output_files/ART17_data.txt"
              format="tabular"
              label="EIONET Art17 - ${directive.subject} (${directive.period})">
            <filter>directive['choice'] == 'art17' and (not directive['country'] or directive['country'] not in (['EU'], 'EU'))</filter>
        </data>
                <data name="output_art17_eu" from_work_dir="output_files/ART17_EU_data.txt"
              format="tabular"
              label="EIONET Art17 EU - ${directive.subject} (${directive.period})">
            <filter>directive['choice'] == 'art17' and directive['period'] != '2019-2024' and (not directive['country'] or 'EU' in directive['country'])</filter>
        </data>

    </outputs>


    <tests>
        <test expect_num_outputs="1">
            <conditional name="directive">
                <param name="choice" value="art12"/>
                <param name="subject" value="Ciconia ciconia"/>
                <param name="period" value="2013-2018"/>
                <param name="country" value="all_countries"/>
            </conditional>
            <output name="output_ms">
                <assert_contents>
                    <has_text text="Ciconia ciconia"/>
                    <has_n_lines n="25"/>
                    <has_n_columns n="46"/>
                </assert_contents>
            </output>

        </test>
                <test expect_num_outputs="2">
            <conditional name="directive">
                <param name="choice" value="art12"/>
                <param name="subject" value="Ciconia ciconia"/>
                <param name="period" value="2013-2018"/>
                <param name="country" value="EU,FR"/>
            </conditional>
            <output name="output_ms">
                <assert_contents>
                    <has_text text="Ciconia ciconia"/>
                    <has_n_lines n="2"/>
                    <has_n_columns n="46"/>
                </assert_contents>
            </output>
            <output name="output_eu">
                <assert_contents>
                    <has_text text="Ciconia ciconia"/>
                    <has_n_lines n="2"/>
                    <has_n_columns n="21"/>
                </assert_contents>
            </output>
        </test>

                <test expect_num_outputs="2">
            <conditional name="directive">
                <param name="choice" value="art17"/>
                <param name="group" value="Mammals"/>
                <param name="subject" value="Canis lupus"/>
                <param name="period" value="2013-2018"/>
                <param name="country" value="EU,BG"/>
            </conditional>
            <output name="output_art17">
                <assert_contents>
                    <has_text text="Canis lupus"/>
                    <has_n_lines n="4"/>
                    <has_n_columns n="36"/>
                </assert_contents>
            </output>
            <output name="output_art17_eu">
                <assert_contents>
                    <has_text text="Canis lupus"/>
                    <has_n_lines n="10"/>
                    <has_n_columns n="37"/>
                </assert_contents>
            </output>
        </test>
        <test expect_num_outputs="1">
            <conditional name="directive">
                <param name="choice" value="art17"/>
                <param name="group" value="Mammals"/>
                <param name="subject" value="Canis lupus"/>
                <param name="period" value="2019-2024"/>
                <param name="country" value="all_countries"/>
            </conditional>
            <output name="output_art17">
                <assert_contents>
                    <has_text text="Canis lupus"/>
                    <has_n_lines n="49"/>
                    <has_n_columns n="41"/>
                </assert_contents>
            </output>
        </test>
    </tests>

    <help><![CDATA[

Usage
=====

This tool retrieves species conservation status and population data from two related EIONET reporting databases:

- **Article 12** (Birds Directive 2009/147/EC) — for birds only.
- **Article 17** (Habitats Directive 92/43/EEC) — for every other species group (amphibians, arthropods, fish, mammals, molluscs, non-vascular plants, other invertebrates, reptiles, vascular plants).

Article 12 (birds)
-------------------
Provide the scientific (latin) species name, the reporting period, and optionally a country filter.

- **Reporting period**: ``2019-2024``, ``2013-2018``, ``2008-2012``, ``2008-2012bis``
- **Country**: all countries, a specific Member State, or the EU28 population status 

Note: For the 2019–2024 period, the EU28 population status is not yet available.


Article 17 (other groups)
--------------------------
Provide the taxonomic group, the scientific (latin) species name exactly as listed on the EIONET Article 17 portal for that group, the reporting period, and optionally a single bio-geographical region and the country.

- **Group**: Amphibians, Arthropods, Fish, Mammals, Molluscs, Non-vascular plants, Other invertebrates, Reptiles, Vascular plants
- **Reporting period**: ``2019-2024``, ``2013-2018``, ``2007-2012bis``, ``2007-2012``, ``2001-2006``
- **Bio-region**: Alpine, Atlantic, Black Sea, Boreal, Continental, Mediterranean, Pannonian, or all regions
- **Country**: all countries, or one or more specific Member States

Notes
=====
Some species are still listed under an outdated scientific name. If you have any doubts, check the names in the Eionet databases linked just below.

Data sources
============
- EIONET Article 12 web tool — https://nature-art12.eionet.europa.eu/article12/
- EIONET Article 17 web tool — https://nature-art17.eionet.europa.eu/article17/

Data reported by EU Member States under Directive 2009/147/EC (Birds) and Directive 92/43/EEC (Habitats).

    ]]></help>

